{"id":"ce790f46cab0681e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition.md","title":"Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA","display":"df-epsilon-nfa-run — Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition","aliases":["73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition","73-df-epsilon-nfa-run"],"display":"df-epsilon-nfa-run — Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","[[73-df-epsilon-reachability]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.4, pp. 24–28; local typed epsilon labels and closure functions","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition</span><span>73-df-epsilon-nfa-run</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-nfa-run — Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4625243fc1dd8f0\" href=\"?note=f4625243fc1dd8f0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-reachability\">73-df-epsilon-reachability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.4, pp. 24–28; local typed epsilon labels and closure functions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (epsilon-NFA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span> (epsilon closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4625243fc1dd8f0\" href=\"?note=f4625243fc1dd8f0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-reachability\">73-df-epsilon-reachability</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q\">\\(q\\in Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>；空词子句与后继子句共享这组参数类型。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\right)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\right)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion on input length is well founded; epsilon closure is applied before input and after every consumed symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"554f551d165cef7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-reachability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"554f551d165cef7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}$ (epsilon-NFA, see [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)$ (epsilon closure, see [[73-df-epsilon-reachability]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\right)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)","display":true}],"bytes":1998,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ffa4d7b72a6a19e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition]]，$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-language-semantics]]；无下标的扩张转移只用于这个固定 $M$。"},{"id":"b4ab199feb1a8020","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)$ (extended transition, see [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition]])"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition|Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA]]"}],"outgoing":["554f551d165cef7f","f4625243fc1dd8f0"]}